  "as_of": "2022-09-28",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would change levies on manufacturing ozone-depleting substances and synthetic greenhouse gases, removing statutory rate caps while adding a cost recovery limit.",
   "Rates would be set through regulations, subject to the minister being satisfied that the levy system recovers no more than likely program administration costs.",
   "The manufacturing changes would operate with the companion ozone protection reforms and apply to reporting periods starting from commencement, with earlier periods retaining existing arrangements."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "The $165 per tonne cap for manufacturing synthetic greenhouse gases would be removed.",
   "The minister could delegate levy exemption decisions to specified departmental officials.",
   "Suspension of a manufacturing licence would not remove liability for levies on production before or during the suspension."
  ],
  "affected": "Licensed manufacturers of covered substances would be affected.",
